https://www.passportjs.org/packages/
https://docs.nestjs.com/recipes/passport

install this packages:

$ npm install --save @nestjs/passport passport passport-local
$ npm install --save-dev @types/passport-local

we need the user folder ->
user.entity -> model
user.module.ts -> import the service
user.service.ts -> in this we added the user data and the get user method


now we create the auth folder ->
in this we create the auth folder ->
auth.module.ts -> import the user module, passport module
local.strategy.ts -> in this we added the logic for the validate username and password and extend proerties from the passport library 

now we go to the main module and add the app module ts provider. -> local startegy
main controller -> include the auth guard and cretae the login routes

